  "description": "The proposed works are to be the removal of the existing Sliding Sash windows in timber with and without obscure glass to be replaced with double-glazed TRC Heritage Sash timber windows.\nThe existing timber framed sliding sash bay windows are to be double-glazed TRC timber sash heritage bay windows.\nThe existing fixed window pane in timber to be a side hung TRC heritage timber casement window.\nThe existing surrounding timber window frames with the top three panes in coloured leaded glass by the uPVC double door on the rear elevation are to be Genesis Heritage. \nThe dimensions of the proposed windows will be the same as the existing windows. The proposed windows will achieve a \"like for like\" appearance of the existing windows.\nThe leaded glass will remain.",
